{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q4673258","formula":"C₂₅H₃₄N₆O₃","hill":"C25H34N6O3","elements":["H","C","N","O"],"composition":{"C":25.0,"H":34.0,"N":6.0,"O":3.0},"names":{"en":"Acetildenafil"},"descriptions":{"en":"Acetildenafil (hongdenafil) is a synthetic drug which acts as a phosphodiesterase inhibitor. It is an analog of sildenafil (Viagra) which has been detected in numerous different brands of \"herbal aphrodisiac\" products sold in convenience stores that claim to boost libido and alleviate erectile dysfunction. A range of designer analogs of licensed PDE5 inhibitors such as sildenafil and vardenafil have been detected in recent years in over-the-counter herbal aphrodisiac products, in an apparent attempt to circumvent both the legal restrictions on sale of erectile dysfunction drugs, which are prescription-only medicines in most Western countries, and the patent protection which allows sale of th…"},"fame":4,"pubchemCid":29918992,"mass":466.6,"charge":0,"smiles":"CCCC1=NN(C2=C1NC(=NC2=O)C3=C(C=CC(=C3)C(=O)CN4CCN(CC4)CC)OCC)C","inchikey":"RRBRQNALHKQCAI-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"5-[2-ethoxy-5-[2-(4-ethylpiperazin-1-yl)acetyl]phenyl]-1-methyl-3-propyl-4H-pyrazolo[4,5-d]pyrimidin-7-one","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"29918992","atoms":68,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-3.672,"y":-2.018,"z":1.781,"el":"O"},{"x":2.253,"y":-2.592,"z":-0.368,"el":"O"},{"x":1.782,"y":3.573,"z":-0.604,"el":"O"},{"x":-4.967,"y":0.109,"z":0.608,"el":"N"},{"x":-7.416,"y":0.763,"z":-0.782,"el":"N"},{"x":3.034,"y":-0.176,"z":0.418,"el":"N"},{"x":4.645,"y":2.838,"z":-0.051,"el":"N"},{"x":5.759,"y":2.137,"z":0.254,"el":"N"},{"x":1.27,"y":1.365,"z":-0.169,"el":"N"},{"x":-5.577,"y":1.439,"z":0.723,"el":"C"},{"x":-5.29,"y":-0.492,"z":-0.692,"el":"C"},{"x":-7.094,"y":1.364,"z":0.